    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize learning by adapting explanations based on a student’s level or mistakes. They could also provide interactive problem-solving, like games or simulations, making abstract concepts more engaging. For someone like me, who struggles with traditional methods, this would be a game-changer."
